[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 13020.87, "timestamp": "03:37:00", "text": "找到的是合适的人，而不是有才能的人。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13022.91, "timestamp": "03:37:02", "text": "从这里开始构建你的基础设施"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13025.67, "timestamp": "03:37:05", "text": "进去之后，把人才招进来，然后去做。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13028.15, "timestamp": "03:37:08", "text": "侦察、侦察以及一切或汽车"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13030.07, "timestamp": "03:37:10", "text": "这是我的主要建议，如果你曾经……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13032.07, "timestamp": "03:37:12", "text": "有人打算创办一家代理公司吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13034.309, "timestamp": "03:37:14", "text": "然后你就会得到类似这样的东西。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13036.91, "timestamp": "03:37:16", "text": "同事们都很棒，这是一方面。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13039.19, "timestamp": "03:37:19", "text": "加入时必不可少"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13041.349, "timestamp": "03:37:21", "text": "企业环境"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 13044.054, "timestamp": "03:37:24", "author": "@Surya_VT", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/xYZGMsDSkF4w1IOdT2xKmMHI-M3-NParGStQvKERjxxwivecaInz95y5n8jliQSZ7SgMMYzdrw=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "ya need clippers, editors, artist, and much more"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13044.309, "timestamp": "03:37:24", "text": "你必须和同龄人相处融洽。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13047.19, "timestamp": "03:37:27", "text": "同事，公司同事。不会的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13049.11, "timestamp": "03:37:29", "text": "总是要表现得友好，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13051.83, "timestamp": "03:37:31", "text": "友善、快乐、快乐的好朋友"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13054.229, "timestamp": "03:37:34", "text": "不管是什么东西。它将会"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13056.03, "timestamp": "03:37:36", "text": "保持竞争力"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13059.91, "timestamp": "03:37:39", "text": "职场瞬间。所以将会有一个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13063.59, "timestamp": "03:37:43", "text": "同辈压力。会有很多……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13066.63, "timestamp": "03:37:46", "text": "事情就是这样，对吧？但即使存在冲突，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13069.19, "timestamp": "03:37:49", "text": "即使冲突发生，你仍然"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13071.349, "timestamp": "03:37:51", "text": "得把这件事放在一边。保持你的骄傲"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13073.91, "timestamp": "03:37:53", "text": "撇开所有这些不谈，你仍然"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 13075.567, "timestamp": "03:37:55", "author": "@Surya_VT", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/xYZGMsDSkF4w1IOdT2xKmMHI-M3-NParGStQvKERjxxwivecaInz95y5n8jliQSZ7SgMMYzdrw=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "like a idol trainee group"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13078.469, "timestamp": "03:37:58", "text": "必须开心，并且要展示自己。"}]